{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12233090","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12233090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1223309001:0":{"text":"아론, 잔재주가 꽤 쓸만하게 늘었군. 이 파리도 당신이 붙인 거겠지?","source_cn":"是阿隆啊？小动作还挺熟练，苍蝇是你粘的吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF34602ACA033F7C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223309002:0":{"text":"시끄러워! 너희를 도와주는 사람만 없었어도 오늘 개업하자마자 파산하게 해줄 수 있었다고!","source_cn":"少废话！要不是你们有帮手，今天让你们从开业变破产！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D043133E455B71F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223309003:0":{"text":"...레나타가 보낸 거군. 물건도 당신들이 가로챈 건가?","source_cn":"……是雷纳塔让你们来的吧。货也是你们劫的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AE79732A4565151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223309004:0":{"text":"쯧, 귀찮은 마법사만 아니었다면 너희 같은 쫄보 자식들은 러스트 항에서 쫓아버렸을 텐데!","source_cn":"嘁，要不是这碍事的魔法师，今天我要你们这帮软皮蛇消失在...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x684C2B01F4505529","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"쯧, 귀찮은 마법사만 아니었다면 너희 같은 쫄보 자식들은 러스트 항에서 쫓아버렸을 텐데!","female":"쯧, 귀찮은 마법사만 아니었다면 너희 같은 쫄보 자식들은 러스트 항에서 쫓아버렸을 텐데!","variant_male_record_index":"140062","variant_female_record_index":"140063","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223309005:1":{"text":"하! 너희였나? 누가 누구보고 쫄보라는 거야?!","source_cn":"哈！？原来是你们？你叫谁软皮蛇？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B46CAF1F0A81438","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1223309006:1":{"text":"오? 물건을 빼앗겼을 때는 네 발로 기어서 도망가더니, 이젠 큰소리를 치겠다?","source_cn":"喔？劫车时你被吓的跟狗一样，现在吼这么大声？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AFF610297302A12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1223309007:1":{"text":"너!","source_cn":"你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E09533AB6340482","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1223309008:1":{"text":"곧 다시 찾아오마, 쫄보 자식들! 하하하...","source_cn":"我们还会来的！软皮蛇们！哈哈哈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x511412A6C2D29B2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水鬼帮阿尔":{"text":"물귀신파 아르","source":"水鬼帮阿尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:水鬼帮阿隆":{"text":"물귀신파 아론","source":"水鬼帮阿隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:水鬼帮梭罗":{"text":"솔로","source":"水鬼帮梭罗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}